<view class="page"><view class="title">导入词表</view><view class="sub">每行输入“英文 | 中文”，也支持 TXT 文件。无 API 时可直接导入，学习功能照常使用。</view><button class="btn light" bindtap="chooseFile">从微信聊天选择 TXT</button><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="Delegate | 代表\nSecretariat | 秘书处" value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1" /><button class="btn" bindtap="parse">解析并预览</button><view class="sub">{{message}}</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{count}}"><view wx:for="{{sample}}" wx:key="text" class="space"><text>{{item.text}} · {{item.translation}}</text><view class="small muted">{{item.phonetic}} {{item.roots}} {{item.example}}</view></view><view class="small muted space" wx:if="{{count>20}}">仅显示前 20 条，导入时包含全部 {{count}} 条。</view><button class="btn light" bindtap="enrich" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">用 DeepSeek 补全</button><button class="btn" bindtap="import" disabled="{{loading}}">确认导入词库</button></view><view class="card"><view class="title">可选 AI 接口</view><view class="sub">填写部署后的 Cloudflare HTTPS 地址和词库补全访问口令。DeepSeek API Key 只保存在服务器，不能填在这里。</view><input class="input" placeholder="https://你的域名" value="{{apiBase}}" bindinput="apiInput" /><input class="input" password="true" placeholder="词库补全访问口令" value="{{token}}" bindinput="tokenInput" /><button class="btn light" bindtap="saveApi">保存接口设置</button></view><view class="card"><view class="title">学习备份</view><button class="btn light" bindtap="backup">导出 JSON 备份</button><button class="btn light" bindtap="restore">恢复 JSON 备份</button></view></view>
